STEP_RISK[speedup]="low — only edits dotfiles, all reversible."

STEP_NAME[polish]="Daily-use polish"
STEP_DESC[polish]="Wire up the pager, set your git identity, add delta, and tune fzf."
STEP_EXPLAIN[polish]="Everything you touch daily: (1) bat becomes your pager for git/apt/less; (2) your git user.name and user.email, without which every commit fails; (3) delta, which renders git diffs side-by-side in colour; (4) fzf defaults with a border and taller list; (5) trimming redundant nerd-font variants, ~180M of dead weight; (6) Ctrl-R bound to atuin history search through fzf; (7) goon mode, which prints a timing + exit-code glyph after every command in a hue that drifts with system load, plus tfgo for full-screen animation. Each is asked separately and can be declined."
STEP_RISK[polish]="low — writes ~/.zshrc and ~/.gitconfig; may delete redundant nerd-font variants from ~/.fonts (asks first)."

